    "description": "Professor Javaid Khan, Head, Section of Pulmonology, Department of Medicine, Aga Khan University, Karachi has been awarded the World Health Organization's World No Tobacco Day medal 'in recognition of his outstanding contribution to tobacco control' efforts in Pakistan; Professor Khan, also chairs the National Alliance for Tobacco Control (NATC).",
